wasm3
------------------------------------------
A high performance WebAssembly interpreter written in C.

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.11-1
  libgcc1-14.4.0-1
  libuvwasi0-0.0.23-1bl3

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  binutils-2.47-1
  cmake-4.4.4-1
  cygport-0.37.11-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  libuvwasi-devel-0.0.23-1bl3
  ninja-1.13.2-1
  python3-3.12.12-1

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/wasm3/wasm3

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/wasm3/wasm3/archive/refs/tags/v0.9.0.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack wasm3-0.9.0-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./wasm3-0.9.0-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/wasm3-0.9.0-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/wasm3-0.9.0-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(wasm3)
  /usr/bin/wasm3.exe
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/wasm3.README
  /usr/share/doc/wasm3/Cookbook.md
  /usr/share/doc/wasm3/Demos.md
  /usr/share/doc/wasm3/Development.md
  /usr/share/doc/wasm3/Diagnostics.md
